    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d771">

                <pb facs="0930" n="836" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg836"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr. Lee.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-10-06"><hi rendition="#italic">October 6,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 116.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your dispatch No. 152, of the 30th ultimo,
                    with inclosures, relative to the case of Julio Sanguily, has been received, and
                    in reply you are informed that our minister at Madrid cabled to the Department
                    on the 3d instant that this case has been remanded for a new trial.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
